    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39923" root="نصر" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَصِيرٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاصِرٌ</span>. It has the signification of
the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَاعِلٌ</span> or of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَفْعُولٌ</span>;
for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخَوَانِ نَصِيرَانِ</span>, occurring in a trad., means
<i>Two brothers, aiders of,</i> and <i>aided by, each
other.</i> (TA.)

